From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 10:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] plat-rz: hw_rng_tsip: cast memcpy destination back to void *

Upstream-Status: Pending

GCC 15.2 (wrynose toolchain default) rejects passing a uintptr_t to memcpy's
void * destination argument under -Werror=int-conversion. Wrap the integer
arithmetic in (void *) so the cast back to a pointer is explicit at the call
site.

Signed-off-by: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-rz/common/hw_rng_tsip.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-rz/common/hw_rng_tsip.c b/core/arch/arm/plat-rz/common/hw_rng_tsip.c
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-rz/common/hw_rng_tsip.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-rz/common/hw_rng_tsip.c
@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@ TEE_Result hw_get_random_bytes(void *buf, size_t len)
 		if (TEE_SUCCESS != ret)
 			return ret;

-		memcpy((uintptr_t)buf + i, buffer, MIN(sizeof(buffer), len - i));
+		memcpy((void *)((uintptr_t)buf + i), buffer, MIN(sizeof(buffer), len - i));
 	}

 	return ret;
